// Objective - FirstPatrol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1797083415" "MAGI cannot hope to stop our plans. Did they really believe they could keep this book from us?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P70099316" "This is...surprising."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2775947979" "Hopefully Tarses will master the Simulacrum spell in time."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P430032273" "We will not lose the book, not when we've come so far!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2582784086" "Do we have the proper spot picked out?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2931159095" "Can we not have a moments peace?!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1626069663" "Several points throughout the city. Terra Volta, Faultline, perhaps even the Ziggurat..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1259970715" "<shout>Kill the intruders!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2860201472" "<shout>Azuria will pay for this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1028333684" "With the Lance of Storms we shall finally have the power to destroy our ancient enemies!"
