// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2014239191" "When I've finished with you I will take your body as my vessel."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P528309507" "Ignorant fool, you are only prolonging the innevitable!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3099917609" "Curse this feeble body! Guards!"
